    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLAG-O-TRON is a new kind of deckbuilding with flags and chess pieces.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/d9d8ce855b770b6b31b15b4c523a8206.poster.avif?t=1755591186\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/d9d8ce855b770b6b31b15b4c523a8206.webm?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/d9d8ce855b770b6b31b15b4c523a8206.mp4?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, deeply tactical as it unfolds \u2014 a flagbuilder that combines the recognizable structure of a roguelike with an original combo-building mechanic, offering dozens of unique decisions in every run.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/0fdec2d43bd21a11d1573422182e199e.poster.avif?t=1755591186\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/0fdec2d43bd21a11d1573422182e199e.webm?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/0fdec2d43bd21a11d1573422182e199e.mp4?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No cards \u2014 just flags. No hand \u2014 just a board, where you create winning combos.</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/9171d636f2360ef04c503d1fa1e8e0dd.poster.avif?t=1755591186\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/9171d636f2360ef04c503d1fa1e8e0dd.webm?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/9171d636f2360ef04c503d1fa1e8e0dd.mp4?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i></i><br><br><br><i>Every turn is a decision. Every combo is a step toward victory \u2014 or defeat.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/48b1dafbfc4bee41fbb7846df118ec50.poster.avif?t=1755591186\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/48b1dafbfc4bee41fbb7846df118ec50.webm?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/48b1dafbfc4bee41fbb7846df118ec50.mp4?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use chess pieces to move flags across the board, unlock new slots in the shop, and upgrade your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/f1cc155262664ef9dedd97c8b17d1fad.poster.avif?t=1755591186\" width=800 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/f1cc155262664ef9dedd97c8b17d1fad.webm?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/f1cc155262664ef9dedd97c8b17d1fad.mp4?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your strategy, boost your flags with modifiers, discover rare upgrades, and create high-value chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/0ca5444f43496987e7def910722dc587.poster.avif?t=1755591186\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/0ca5444f43496987e7def910722dc587.webm?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/0ca5444f43496987e7def910722dc587.mp4?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each round, you\u2019ll face a boss. Who it\u2019ll be is a mystery \u2014 maybe one that wipes all upgrades from your active flags. Or one that turns every piece into a pawn, cutting off your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss comes with unique effects and interferes with the core mechanics, changing the rules mid-game. Sometimes they\u2019ll block movement, reset your score, strip away upgrades, or destroy key parts of the board. With every encounter, you\u2019ll need to rethink your strategy on the fly \u2014 adapt or lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/52e89ec6392db36d6a03a6cd64ac7821.poster.avif?t=1755591186\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/52e89ec6392db36d6a03a6cd64ac7821.webm?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/52e89ec6392db36d6a03a6cd64ac7821.mp4?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLAGOTRON offers a structured, well-designed gameplay loop with high replayability.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Tactical flag placement and thoughtful <i><strong>combo-building</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chess piece mechanics to interact with the board and unlock progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An upgrade system that changes flag properties and point output</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between-run progression and expanding pool of available tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses with unique debuffs that reshape each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High replayability:</strong> every run brings new conditions, choices, and strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover your own path to victory \u2014 through upgrades, risk, precision, or unexpected synergies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every run is a fresh set of rules, chances, and choices. </strong><br>  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/fb7afb9c8bcd8b45d5544a450ae1ae22.poster.avif?t=1755591186\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/fb7afb9c8bcd8b45d5544a450ae1ae22.webm?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/fb7afb9c8bcd8b45d5544a450ae1ae22.mp4?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong>There\u2019s no universal strategy \u2014 but there\u2019s always that<strong> <i>one move</i> </strong>that can change everything.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLAG-O-TRON is a new kind of deckbuilding with flags and chess pieces.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/d9d8ce855b770b6b31b15b4c523a8206.poster.avif?t=1755591186\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/d9d8ce855b770b6b31b15b4c523a8206.webm?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/d9d8ce855b770b6b31b15b4c523a8206.mp4?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, deeply tactical as it unfolds \u2014 a flagbuilder that combines the recognizable structure of a roguelike with an original combo-building mechanic, offering dozens of unique decisions in every run.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/0fdec2d43bd21a11d1573422182e199e.poster.avif?t=1755591186\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/0fdec2d43bd21a11d1573422182e199e.webm?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/0fdec2d43bd21a11d1573422182e199e.mp4?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No cards \u2014 just flags. No hand \u2014 just a board, where you create winning combos.</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/9171d636f2360ef04c503d1fa1e8e0dd.poster.avif?t=1755591186\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/9171d636f2360ef04c503d1fa1e8e0dd.webm?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/9171d636f2360ef04c503d1fa1e8e0dd.mp4?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i></i><br><br><br><i>Every turn is a decision. Every combo is a step toward victory \u2014 or defeat.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/48b1dafbfc4bee41fbb7846df118ec50.poster.avif?t=1755591186\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/48b1dafbfc4bee41fbb7846df118ec50.webm?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/48b1dafbfc4bee41fbb7846df118ec50.mp4?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use chess pieces to move flags across the board, unlock new slots in the shop, and upgrade your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/f1cc155262664ef9dedd97c8b17d1fad.poster.avif?t=1755591186\" width=800 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/f1cc155262664ef9dedd97c8b17d1fad.webm?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/f1cc155262664ef9dedd97c8b17d1fad.mp4?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your strategy, boost your flags with modifiers, discover rare upgrades, and create high-value chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/0ca5444f43496987e7def910722dc587.poster.avif?t=1755591186\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/0ca5444f43496987e7def910722dc587.webm?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/0ca5444f43496987e7def910722dc587.mp4?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each round, you\u2019ll face a boss. Who it\u2019ll be is a mystery \u2014 maybe one that wipes all upgrades from your active flags. Or one that turns every piece into a pawn, cutting off your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss comes with unique effects and interferes with the core mechanics, changing the rules mid-game. Sometimes they\u2019ll block movement, reset your score, strip away upgrades, or destroy key parts of the board. With every encounter, you\u2019ll need to rethink your strategy on the fly \u2014 adapt or lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/52e89ec6392db36d6a03a6cd64ac7821.poster.avif?t=1755591186\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/52e89ec6392db36d6a03a6cd64ac7821.webm?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/52e89ec6392db36d6a03a6cd64ac7821.mp4?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLAGOTRON offers a structured, well-designed gameplay loop with high replayability.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Tactical flag placement and thoughtful <i><strong>combo-building</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chess piece mechanics to interact with the board and unlock progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An upgrade system that changes flag properties and point output</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between-run progression and expanding pool of available tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses with unique debuffs that reshape each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High replayability:</strong> every run brings new conditions, choices, and strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover your own path to victory \u2014 through upgrades, risk, precision, or unexpected synergies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every run is a fresh set of rules, chances, and choices. </strong><br>  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/fb7afb9c8bcd8b45d5544a450ae1ae22.poster.avif?t=1755591186\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/fb7afb9c8bcd8b45d5544a450ae1ae22.webm?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718740/extras/fb7afb9c8bcd8b45d5544a450ae1ae22.mp4?t=1755591186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong>There\u2019s no universal strategy \u2014 but there\u2019s always that<strong> <i>one move</i> </strong>that can change everything.</p>",
